[7.682454, "o", "│  mass sits in a speck 10,000× smaller than the atom. \u001b[33mnucleus = marble,\r\n│  atom = the stadium. the 'solid' silicon was a force scaffold.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n│  \u001b[2mlive: alphas crossing the foil:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
